 host told the user this report is saved on this machine and nothing is sent (feedback_mode 'bundle' when it read the mode). Honored even if the mode has since become 'post' or 'share' (a mid-session sign-in): the report is bundled, never sent; a mode of 'disabled' still refuses it. Ignored with draft_id.")}).describe("@internal Submits a /feedback report (description + current session transcript + sanitized error log) to api.anthropic.com/api/claude_cli_feedback using the CLI's auth and redaction. Runs the same getFeedbackUnavailableReason() policy checks as the terminal /feedback command \u2014 when feedback is disabled (org policy, env kill-switch) or cannot be sent (3P provider, no Anthropic credentials) the response carries unavailable_reason instead of an error. A request carrying save_locally gets the terminal's local save instead: the report is written to a redacted zip on this machine and the response carries bundle_path, nothing sent \u2014 except where feedback is disabled, which still refuses.")),yY=f(()=>u({feedback_id:o().nullable(),unavailable_reason:o().optional().describe("Human-readable reason /feedback is disabled in this session (3P provider, org policy, env var). When set, no submission was attempted."),is_zdr_org:M().optional(),failure_reason:o().optional(),status_code:E().int().optional(),ccshare_url:o().optional().describe("Internal share URL for the conversation. Only set in internal builds, when the upload succeeded or was handed to the host machine to finish (the page then appears once the person confirms the upload there); absent otherwise."),bundle_path:o().optional().describe("In 'bundle' feedback mode (SDKFeedbackMode): the absolute path of the redacted zip the report was written to on this machine, instead of being sent; feedback_id is then the bundle id. Absent in every other mode.")}).describe("@internal Result of a submit_feedback request. feedback_id is set on success (a sent report, or a bundle written to bundle_path); otherwise 